---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Uses · Janis Schubert">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Uses</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">Things I work with. Mostly so I remember what I changed and why.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">Hardware</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5">
      <li>MacBook Pro 14", the fan almost never comes on</li>
      <li>One external 27" display, I tried two and kept turning my head</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">Software</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5">
      <li>VS Code with the default dark theme, I stopped changing themes every month</li>
      <li>iTerm2 with zsh, no framework, a handful of aliases</li>
      <li>Firefox for browsing, Chrome for devtools</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-10"><a class="underline" href="/">Back</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
